      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Signature Inks : Infuse your spells with one of 6 colorful classes , complete with their own unique upgrades and rewarding challenges! Scrolls of Power : Tear through enemies with over 300 powers for you and your team. All powers can be build-makers, no filler. Shaping Your Spellbook : Wield and combine an imaginative roster of over 20 spells - conjure Sewing Needles, hurl Anchors, sling Playing Cards - then enhance them with limit-breaking augments!",
